# Notifactions
# Jenkins Pipeline - Email Natifactions
You will learn how to **Send email notifacations on failure or success**.
pipeline {
    agent any
    environment {
        INSTITUTE_NAME = "DevOps"
    }
    stages {
        stage('checkout') {
            steps {
                git url: 'https://github.com/pathnex/sample-java-app.git'
            }
        }
        stage('Build') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn clean package'
            }
        }
    }
    post {
        success {
            mail to: 'team@DevOps.com',
                 subject: "SUCCESS: Build #${ env.BUILD_NUMBER}",
                 budy: "Build complated successfull for ${env.INSTITUTE_NAME}"
        }
        failure {
            mail to: 'team@DevOps.com',
                 subject: "FAILURE: Build #${env.BUILD_NUMBER}",
                 body: "Build completed successfully for $INSTITUTE_NAME"
        }
    }
}

# GitLab CI - Notifications
You will learn how to **notify via email after job completion**.

stages:
  - build

  build-job:
    stage: build
    image: maven:3.8.1-jdk-17
    script:
      - git clone https://github.com/pathnex/sample-java-app.git
      - cd sample-java-app
      - mvn clean package
